       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-AIRY-STRAT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-AIRY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-RADIAL-ENERGY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QUADTREE-BOUNDS-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HARDWARE-DISPATCH-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-AIRY-STRAT-LATENCY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-AIRY-STRAT-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-AIRY-STRAT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PAI-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PAI-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-RADIAL-AND-QUADTREE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-HARDWARE-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PAI-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-RADIAL-AND-QUADTREE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RADIAL-ENERGY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-QUADTREE-BOUNDS-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-HARDWARE-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HARDWARE-DISPATCH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AIRY-STRAT-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PAI-PROOFS.
           IF WS-RADIAL-ENERGY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-QUADTREE-BOUNDS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HARDWARE-DISPATCH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-AIRY-STRAT-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-AIRY-STRAT-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PAI-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PAI-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PAI-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PAI-CODE.
